# Lookup Infrastructure

## The 29 keys (exhaustive)
nameTitle, industryType, addressType, country, pocList, clientType,
partnerList, aquiredPartnerList, feeEarnerList, personAssistList,
allUserAssignList, practicesArea, companyClients, feeType, expenseType,
entitiesStatusType, department, currency, clientGroup, caseType,
caseStatusType, billingType, roundingIncrements, userTypes, timezones,
chargeTypes, legalAidStatuses.

## Cache rules
- Two TTL tiers: shortCacheDuration (volatile: companyClients,
  allUserAssignList, feeEarnerList) and longCacheDuration (stable:
  country, currency, timezones).
- Expose cacheTimestamps per key.
- forceRefresh(key), invalidate(key), invalidateAll().
- Batch fetch all keys in one Future.wait on login.
- Auto-invalidate volatile keys on AppLifecycleState.resumed.
- Expose loadingState and errorState per key.